<mxCell id="n444" value="Excise Crime Report System: database (SQLite, 25 tables)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1100" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n445" value="Generated from packages/db/migrations 0001-0003. &lt;b&gt;?&lt;/b&gt; = nullable, &lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; = primary key, &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; = foreign key (blue), &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; = unique (one row per parent). Every table also has created_at, updated_at, updated_by, version (optimistic lock) and deleted_at (soft delete), except audit_log (append-only). Dates are ISO text, money is integer cents, flags are 0/1." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4b5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="42" width="1180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n446" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the lines:&lt;/b&gt; the three-pronged end is the &quot;many&quot; side (the table holding the FK), the bar end is the parent. Green lines from the CR details all join one trunk into crime_reports; lines to the left are lookups; orange lines are the court-case chain." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4b5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="86" width="1180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n447" value="&lt;b&gt;Views (0002)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v_reference_items&lt;/b&gt; = all 14 lookup lists as one list (offices, years, offence_types, officers by kind, courts, police_areas, divisional_secretariats).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v_report_rows&lt;/b&gt; = one row per live CR joined to accused, offence, detecting officer, informant, case, court, outcomes (convicted date, fine total) and reward voucher; every report filter reads it." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#c9ccd1;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="890" width="280" height="167" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>